<human_speech><blue>The third one was bred against both of the others. It holds a line better than either.<\blue><green>That is what the fortress is for. It has learned what the fortress is for.<\green><blue>We think the population has stopped improving in the ways we predicted, <\blue><golden><shining>Blotto<\golden><\shining><blue>.<\blue><green>We think nothing yet. Play.<\green><\human_speech>
